
  openHC Control4 CA-1 (i.MX6SL "emmet") — kernel-up image.
  1x Cortex-A9, 1GB. ZM5304 Z-Wave, EM35x Zigbee, RTL8723BS Wi-Fi/BT,
  RS-232/485 combo port, 2x USB. No IO-MCU — the IO is native.

  Boot path is U-Boot from SPI-NOR; openHC boots off the eMMC vfat
  partition and does not write flash. Recovery: delete boot.scr.
